#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0519 expect=violation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: A variable ending in EDTF must have a label that ends with "Imputation Flag" (or "Imput. Flag") and contains "End" and "Date"
#note "AEDTF has no Imputation-Flag suffix; BEDTF lacks "End"; CEDTF lacks "Date"; DEDTF carries the phrase but not at the END; EEDTF differs only in CASE. TR1EDTF, TRTEDTF, TR01EDTF and TR99EDTF all carry the SAME label, and only the library tells them apart: TRTEDTF is the ADSL literal TRTEDTF and TR01EDTF / TR99EDTF match the ADSL template TRxxEDTF (D9, PLAN-library-template-label-resolution), so they are no stem case - label_template(\"LIBRARY\", stem=\"*EDTF\") answers a missing for them (R2-3) - and the rule does not judge them; the near-miss TR1EDTF (one digit) matches no template, falls to the *EDTF stem and still fires."
#expectViolationCount 6
#expectViolationAt variable_label="End Date Flag" variable_name=AEDTF
#expectViolationAt variable_label="Analysis Date Imput. Flag" variable_name=BEDTF
#expectViolationAt variable_label="Analysis End Imput. Flag" variable_name=CEDTF
#expectViolationAt variable_label="End Date Imputation Flag Extra" variable_name=DEDTF
#expectViolationAt variable_label="Analysis End Date imputation Flag" variable_name=EEDTF
#expectViolationAt variable_label="Date of Last Exposure Imput. Flag" variable_name=TR1EDTF
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#library variable-metadata ADLBC *EDTF name=*EDTF label="{End Date Imputation Flag}"
#library variable-metadata ADLBC *DTF name=*DTF label="{Date Imputation Flag}"
#library variable-metadata ADSL TRTEDTF name=TRTEDTF label="Date of Last Exposure Imput. Flag"
#library variable-metadata ADSL TRxxEDTF name=TRxxEDTF label="Date Last Exposure Period xx Imput. Flag"
dataset ADLBC class=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AEDTF type=Char label="End Date Flag"
col BEDTF type=Char label="Analysis Date Imput. Flag"
col CEDTF type=Char label="Analysis End Imput. Flag"
col DEDTF type=Char label="End Date Imputation Flag Extra"
col EEDTF type=Char label="Analysis End Date imputation Flag"
col TR1EDTF type=Char label="Date of Last Exposure Imput. Flag"
col TRTEDTF type=Char label="Date of Last Exposure Imput. Flag"
col TR01EDTF type=Char label="Date of Last Exposure Imput. Flag"
col TR99EDTF type=Char label="Date of Last Exposure Imput. Flag"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | x | x | x | x | x | x | x | x | x
---
